# to 作介词（2026-11-25）

## 5 个搭配（后接 doing）
- the key to doing
- be used to doing   ← 注意：还有 be used to do（被用来），两者意思不同
- look forward to doing
- be devoted to doing
- object to doing

## 我的错句
| 我写的 | 错在哪 | 正确 |
|---|---|---|
| the key to enhance yourself | to 是介词，接动名词 | the key to enhancing |
| This pen is used to writing | 把 be used to doing 当万能公式 | This pen is used to write |
| It is devoted to keeping water cycling | 语法对，语义不成立 | — |

## 判断依据（不是结论）
to 的词性由前面的词决定，不由 to 自己决定。
